OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFormer DUP leader Jeffrey
OL,4,ADonaldson sentenced to 15 years in
OL,5,Aprison for child sex abuse
OL,6,
OL,7,FReading statements from the victims
OL,8,Fbefore passing sentence, the judge says
OL,9,Fone woman grew up feeling ashamed,
OL,10,Fwhile the other says: "Every day I pray
OL,11,FGod will let me die"
OL,13,FThe judge says the ex-MP's offences
OL,14,Fhave led to a "catastrophic descent
OL,15,Finto disgrace". He was stripped of his
OL,16,Fknighthood in July
OL,18,FHis wife, Eleanor, faced a "trial of
OL,19,Fthe facts" on mental health grounds,
OL,20,Frelating to five charges, including
OL,21,Ffour related to aiding and abetting
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
