OL,3,GNEWSAFormer DUP leader Jeffrey
OL,4,ADonaldson sentenced to 15 years in
OL,5,Aprison for child sex abuse
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe was found to have "done the acts",
OL,8,Fand will hear about any actions taken
OL,9,Fagainst her at a later date
